    {
      "id": "yILONs5OgwTVYjs8ObGX5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 346.50998995362943,
      "y": -232.7471439238932,
      "width": 847.6193237304688,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 63029398,
      "version": 835,
      "versionNonce": 923185610,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786471726301,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Collaborative filtering - recommend based on user's similarities and shared preference\n-- This method is for rich interaction but had cold start problem for user\nwith sparse interaction history\n- Singular Value Decomposition decompose interaction matrix into latent factors\nrepresenting user preferences and item characteristics\n\n2) Content-based filtering - similar to what user previously engage wity. \n-- Handle cold start for new item well since recommendation only depends on metadata\n\n===> Hybrid approach:\n- DLRM - Deep learning recommendation model\n- DCN - Deep & Cross Network. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Collaborative filtering - recommend based on user's similarities and shared preference\n-- This method is for rich interaction but had cold start problem for user\nwith sparse interaction history\n- Singular Value Decomposition decompose interaction matrix into latent factors\nrepresenting user preferences and item characteristics\n\n2) Content-based filtering - similar to what user previously engage wity. \n-- Handle cold start for new item well since recommendation only depends on metadata\n\n===> Hybrid approach:\n- DLRM - Deep learning recommendation model\n- DCN - Deep & Cross Network. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
