      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786722331105,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Video Features (content based and engagement)\n- Video metadata, thumbnail (extracted via computer vision)\n- Audio features\n- Video quality metrics (resolution, stability)\n- Topic and category embeddings\n- Historical engagment metrics, velocity metrics\n- Creator reputation and historicall performance\n- Monetization status/advertiser friendly\n\nUser Features\n- Topic/Language preference, subscription list, demographic\n- Session-based features\n- Time of day/day of week patterns\n- Device and platform",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Video Features (content based and engagement)\n- Video metadata, thumbnail (extracted via computer vision)\n- Audio features\n- Video quality metrics (resolution, stability)\n- Topic and category embeddings\n- Historical engagment metrics, velocity metrics\n- Creator reputation and historicall performance\n- Monetization status/advertiser friendly\n\nUser Features\n- Topic/Language preference, subscription list, demographic\n- Session-based features\n- Time of day/day of week patterns\n- Device and platform",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
