    {
      "id": "NClsrr_f3g_hawfiXIBqD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1585.2577229262515,
      "y": 4374.563799993786,
      "width": 841.0393676757812,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1153795648,
      "version": 586,
      "versionNonce": 1446264384,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786722997755,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Light ranker: high recall, low latency, high throughput\n--> Tree-based model like Gradient Boosted decision tree (GBDT) \n--> XGBoost/LightGBM\n--> can run on CPU to scale (economically)\n\n- Heavy ranker: high precision, high quality, lower throughput\n--> Transformer-based sequence ranker:\ncapture long-term patterns in user behavior, model complex interaction,\nhandles temporal aspect of recommendation and learn from feedback in context\n-- DLRM (deep learning recommendation model) is a lighter version,\ntreat features as bag with no temporal ordering, and can't capture sequence patterns\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Light ranker: high recall, low latency, high throughput\n--> Tree-based model like Gradient Boosted decision tree (GBDT) \n--> XGBoost/LightGBM\n--> can run on CPU to scale (economically)\n\n- Heavy ranker: high precision, high quality, lower throughput\n--> Transformer-based sequence ranker:\ncapture long-term patterns in user behavior, model complex interaction,\nhandles temporal aspect of recommendation and learn from feedback in context\n-- DLRM (deep learning recommendation model) is a lighter version,\ntreat features as bag with no temporal ordering, and can't capture sequence patterns\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
