    {
      "id": "F4u6TaIt1VOFUPftPPuTG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1582.8429588626955,
      "y": 4755.9777634331585,
      "width": 711.759521484375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2115106240,
      "version": 131,
      "versionNonce": 846247488,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786723160305,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Eg: L = max(0, margin + d(user, positive_video) - d(user, negative_video))\n- Embedding for both user and candidate videos will be stored in \nvector database for retrieval",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Eg: L = max(0, margin + d(user, positive_video) - d(user, negative_video))\n- Embedding for both user and candidate videos will be stored in \nvector database for retrieval",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hxEhld9qPqgGPGTGk3Z5m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1587.290799480554,
      "y": 4874.290323868193,
      "width": 880.5794067382812,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1947008448,
      "version": 98,
      "versionNonce": 1086985664,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786725013083,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Input processing\n* Embedding layers for categorical features (video_id, creator_id, etc.)\n* Normalization layers for numerical features (view counts, engagement rates)\n* Sequence processing for historical features with positional encoding\n* Special tokens to denote different types of user actions (watch, like, share)\n\n2) Feature Interaction\n* Cross-attention layers to model interactions between user history and candidate videos\n* Self-attention layers to capture patterns within user history\n* Feed-forward networks to process the attended information\n* Residual connections and layer normalization for stable training\n\n3) Output layer\n* Watch time prediction (regression)\n* Click-through probability (binary classification)\n* Like probability (binary classification)\n* Share probability (binary classification)\n* Completion rate (regression)\nReturn visit probability (binary classification)\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Input processing\n* Embedding layers for categorical features (video_id, creator_id, etc.)\n* Normalization layers for numerical features (view counts, engagement rates)\n* Sequence processing for historical features with positional encoding\n* Special tokens to denote different types of user actions (watch, like, share)\n\n2) Feature Interaction\n* Cross-attention layers to model interactions between user history and candidate videos\n* Self-attention layers to capture patterns within user history\n* Feed-forward networks to process the attended information\n* Residual connections and layer normalization for stable training\n\n3) Output layer\n* Watch time prediction (regression)\n* Click-through probability (binary classification)\n* Like probability (binary classification)\n* Share probability (binary classification)\n* Completion rate (regression)\nReturn visit probability (binary classification)\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8evIn-ZcwngV43zXQkQxS",
