      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786725073371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Primary Engagement loss\n2) Auxiliary Tasks\n3) Position Bias Correction\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Primary Engagement loss\n2) Auxiliary Tasks\n3) Position Bias Correction\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZpzUwZbQZyDuUFialqRX5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1582.4198315238214,
      "y": 5535.256814059381,
      "width": 377.55987548828125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1970576960,
      "version": 295,
      "versionNonce": 1649954240,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786726291427,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** INFERENCE and EVALUATION ***",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** INFERENCE and EVALUATION ***",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WB2EAetDNmDF34AHZN7bJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1585.4039420934464,
      "y": 5575.270005242687,
      "width": 874.5593872070312,
      "height": 650,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b20",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1429087680,
      "version": 1131,
      "versionNonce": 1456111040,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786726878554,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Inference:\n- Pre-compute the embedding for video and cache them (offline)\n- Cache embeddings for users and cache result of candidate generation\n- For model serving, use technique like \"quantization\" to reduce memory footprint\n- Leverage GPU/TPU hardware to allow serving models with higher throughput\n\nEvaluation framework:\n- offline + online metrics\n- offline metrics can be useful but fraught as we are trying to approximate user behavior,\nbut this gives signal about whether or not online experiment is successful\n- Online evaluation:\n1) A/B testing metrics\n- Session watch time\n- Return visit rate\n- Long term engagement trends\n- Creator satisfaction metrics\n2) User experiment metrics\n- Recommendation acceptance rate\n- Survey feedback\n- Negative feedback rate\n3) System health metrics\n- Latency\n- Throughput\n- Resource utilization\n- Error rate\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Inference:\n- Pre-compute the embedding for video and cache them (offline)\n- Cache embeddings for users and cache result of candidate generation\n- For model serving, use technique like \"quantization\" to reduce memory footprint\n- Leverage GPU/TPU hardware to allow serving models with higher throughput\n\nEvaluation framework:\n- offline + online metrics\n- offline metrics can be useful but fraught as we are trying to approximate user behavior,\nbut this gives signal about whether or not online experiment is successful\n- Online evaluation:\n1) A/B testing metrics\n- Session watch time\n- Return visit rate\n- Long term engagement trends\n- Creator satisfaction metrics\n2) User experiment metrics\n- Recommendation acceptance rate\n- Survey feedback\n- Negative feedback rate\n3) System health metrics\n- Latency\n- Throughput\n- Resource utilization\n- Error rate\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
