      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Popularity Bias and impact filter bubbles and creator behavior optimization\n- To counter this, implement counterfactual logging (behavior on video not\nshown),\ninverse propensity reweighting to debias training data,\n- Periodic offline refreshes with uniformly-sampled impressions help prevent\npopularity bias",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Popularity Bias and impact filter bubbles and creator behavior optimization\n- To counter this, implement counterfactual logging (behavior on video not shown),\ninverse propensity reweighting to debias training data,\n- Periodic offline refreshes with uniformly-sampled impressions help prevent popularity bias",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
