      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786727574728,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- For new user or freshly uploaded video that lack behavioral data\n- Can based on metadata/demographic information, initial onboarding preference,\nto place them into coarse cluster with similar existing users\n- for new videos, extract rick feature from content itself using multimodal models,\nanalyze thumbnails, tiles, descriptions, transcripts, etc...\n- Implement control exploration strategy, where expose new video to diverse\nbut limited audience to quickly gather engagement signal.\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- For new user or freshly uploaded video that lack behavioral data\n- Can based on metadata/demographic information, initial onboarding preference,\nto place them into coarse cluster with similar existing users\n- for new videos, extract rick feature from content itself using multimodal models,\nanalyze thumbnails, tiles, descriptions, transcripts, etc...\n- Implement control exploration strategy, where expose new video to diverse\nbut limited audience to quickly gather engagement signal.\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
